# Python bytecode produced by running harness.py
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Captured evaluation run output must never be source controlled: it can contain
# provider keys, full prompts/responses, and absolute host paths. By default the
# harness writes runs to the workspace root (.amplifier/evaluation/nanoclaw/<run>/),
# outside this repo. These guards cover the case where someone points OUTPUT_DIR
# (or a standalone checkout) at a directory inside this repo.
/results/
/runs/
/output/

# Claw Bench tasks are NEVER vendored. Only the answer-free references under
# tasks-clawbench/*.yaml are committed. The fetched clone (instruction, inputs,
# pytest verifier, expected outputs, oracle solution) and the grading venv land in
# a cache outside this repo by default. Never commit fetched answers.
/.clawbench-cache/
/tasks-clawbench/_fetched/
